    "text": "<p>The correct statement about the following disaccharide is-</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/e4a6db5c-58bd-4cc1-8998-c140ff07ca07-qwqwqa.png\" style=\"width: 629px; height: 312px;\" /></p>",
